            "response": "Thank you for your kind review, Sandy! \nWe're so happy to hear the home fit all your needs! It's nice to see our team was able to assist you in any way. We would love to host you again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The property description was on point for this charming home. We loved the proximity to the beach and Seaside (quick, easy stroll to both), the kitchen and laundry amenities, the spacious shared areas, and multiple cozy porches and patios. Our group had 10 preteens/teens and 5 adults and the home had ample space for all! Any issues we had during the stay were promptly addressed by property management. Would definitely stay here again!",
