        "text": "The house was perfect for 4 adults and 9 teens. It was walkable to beach, Seaside, and Seagrove market, but felt very quiet and removed from the hubbub. The home was thoughtfully appointed with plenty of dishes/utensils in kitchen. Great bedrooms and bathrooms and porches. We enjoyed the pool as well. The management was very attentive and handled a small issue we had very quickly. We would love to stay here again!",
